                <pb facs="1346" n="1322" xml:id="pg1322"/>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Peace Treaty With Italy: Free
                        Territory of Trieste</hi></p>
                <p>The Deputies proceeded, on the instructions of the Ministers,<anchor n="44"
                        xml:id="d363-f1"/> to discuss certain of the principles which were to govern
                    the establishment of permanent and provisional regimes in the Free Territory of
                    Trieste.</p>
                <p>As a result of the discussion a text was established (see Annex) which it was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> the Acting Chairman would submit with his
                    report to the Council at its next meeting.</p>


